e median preoptic nucleus; (c) theanterior part of the anterior hypothalamic nucleus and the retinoceptive regionof the lateral hypothalamic area; (d)and the anterior part of the ventromedial hypothalamic nucleus and theretrochiasmatic area. Scale bars = 200 <italic>&#x003bc;</italic>m.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="NP2009-612698.004"/></fig></floats-group></article>